{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "ayvy-api-collection",
    "name": "AYVY API — Backend",
    "description": "API Spring Boot + MySQL. Imagens em `back/uploads/`; no banco salva o **caminho** (ex.: `/uploads/produtos/uuid.jpg`).\n\n**Imagens:** 1) `POST /upload` (multipart) 2) use `caminho` no JSON do produto/lojista/usuario.\n\n**Cadastro:** POST /usuarios → POST /lojistas ou /clientes com `usuarioId`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8082" },
    { "key": "usuarioId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "clienteId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "lojistaId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "categoriaId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "produtoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "pedidoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "enderecoId", "value": "1" },
    { "key": "bannerCaminho", "value": "/uploads/lojistas/COLE_APOS_UPLOAD_BANNER.jpg" },
    { "key": "logoCaminho", "value": "/uploads/lojistas/COLE_APOS_UPLOAD_LOGO.jpg" },
    { "key": "imagemProdutoCaminho", "value": "/uploads/produtos/COLE_APOS_UPLOAD.jpg" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Fluxo — Lojista com imagens",
      "description": "Execute **na ordem** (1→4). Nos uploads, escolha um arquivo .jpg/.png no campo `file`. Copie `caminho` da resposta ou use os scripts Tests que gravam no ambiente.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1. Criar usuário (papel lojista)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Lojista\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.lojista@ayvy.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"$2b$10$PLACEHOLDER\",\n  \"telefone\": \"11999998888\",\n  \"papel\": \"lojista\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var u = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('usuarioId', u.id);",
                  "  if (pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set('usuarioId', u.id);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "2. Upload banner da loja",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "pasta", "value": "lojistas", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/upload"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('bannerCaminho', j.caminho);",
                  "  if (pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set('bannerCaminho', j.caminho);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "3. Upload logo da loja",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "pasta", "value": "lojistas", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/upload"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  var j = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('logoCaminho', j.caminho);",
                  "  if (pm.environment.name) pm.environment.set('logoCaminho', j.caminho);",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "4. Criar lojista (usa bannerCaminho e logoCaminho)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"usuarioId\": {{usuarioId}},\n  \"nomeLoja\": \"ITB Moda\",\n  \"slug\": \"itb-moda\",\n  \"cnpj\": \"12345678000199\",\n  \"bannerUrl\": \"{{bannerCaminho}}\",\n  \"logoUrl\": \"{{logoCaminho}}\",\n  \"descricao\": \"Loja de moda\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/lojistas",
            "description": "bannerUrl e logoUrl recebem o **caminho** retornado no upload (ex.: /uploads/lojistas/uuid.jpg), NÃO URL externa."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Upload",
      "description": "Salva arquivo em back/uploads/{pasta}/. Resposta: caminho (para o banco) e url (para abrir no navegador).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Upload imagem — produtos",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "pasta", "value": "produtos", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/upload"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload imagem — lojistas",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "pasta", "value": "lojistas", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/upload"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Upload imagem — usuarios (avatar)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "file", "type": "file", "src": [] },
                { "key": "pasta", "value": "usuarios", "type": "text" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/upload"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Usuarios",
      "description": "Passo 1 — identidade. `papel` obrigatório. `status` opcional (default `ativo`). Senha não retorna no GET.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar usuarios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar usuario por ID",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Criar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Lojista\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.lojista@ayvy.com\",\n  \"senha\": \"$2b$10$PLACEHOLDER_TROCAR_NO_BACKEND\",\n  \"telefone\": \"11999998888\",\n  \"papel\": \"lojista\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"nome\": \"Maria Silva Atualizada\",\n  \"email\": \"maria@ayvy.com\",\n  \"telefone\": \"11988887777\",\n  \"papel\": \"lojista\",\n  \"status\": \"ativo\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Deletar usuario",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/usuarios/{{usuarioId}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Categorias",
      "description": "Tabela `categorias`. GET por nome: `/categorias/{nome}` (ex.: Moda feminina).",
